  "description": "<p>DELETEing a Memento (LDPRm) is mostly OK, but the 'id' is incorrect and the ‘isPartOf’ value should perhaps reference the LDPRv, not the repo root.</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>Incoming Message</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n{\r\n   <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@context\"</span>: [\r\n       <span class=\"code-quote\">\"https:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/activitystreams\"</span>,\r\n</span>       {\r\n           <span class=\"code-quote\">\"dcterms\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//purl.org/dc/terms/\"</span>,\r\n</span>           <span class=\"code-quote\">\"id\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@id\"</span>,\r\n           <span class=\"code-quote\">\"isPartOf\"</span>: {\r\n               <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@id\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"dcterms:isPartOf\"</span>,\r\n               <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@type\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@id\"</span>\r\n           },\r\n           <span class=\"code-quote\">\"prov\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/prov#\"</span>,\r\n</span>           <span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@type\"</span>\r\n       }\r\n   ],\r\n   <span class=\"code-quote\">\"actor\"</span>: [\r\n       {\r\n           <span class=\"code-quote\">\"id\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"info:fedora/local-user#fedoraAdmin\"</span>,\r\n           <span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span>: [\r\n               <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Person\"</span>\r\n           ]\r\n       },\r\n       {\r\n           <span class=\"code-quote\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"curl/7.60.0\"</span>,\r\n           <span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span>: [\r\n               <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Application\"</span>\r\n          ]\r\n       }\r\n   ],\r\n   <span class=\"code-quote\">\"id\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"urn:uuid:9bee1808-3a83-4eeb-8563-0ef9344e1326\"</span>,\r\n   <span class=\"code-quote\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"delete resource\"</span>,\r\n   <span class=\"code-quote\">\"object\"</span>: {\r\n       <span class=\"code-quote\">\"id\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/versioning/14/fedora:timemap/20180920195019\"</span>,\r\n</span>       <span class=\"code-quote\">\"isPartOf\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>\"</span>,\r\n</span>       <span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span>: [\r\n           <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Container\"</span>,\r\n</span>           <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#Resource\"</span>,\r\n</span>           <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#RDFSource\"</span>,\r\n</span>           <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//mementoweb.org/ns#Memento\"</span>,\r\n</span>           <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#BasicContainer\"</span>,\r\n</span>           <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity\"</span>\r\n</span>       ]\r\n   },\r\n   <span class=\"code-quote\">\"published\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"2018-09-20T19:50:53.894Z\"</span>,\r\n   <span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span>: [\r\n       <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Delete\"</span>\r\n   ]\r\n}\r\n \r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>",
